# Hybrid variant: monodomainSolver + restitutionEikonalSolver1D.
#
# This probe reads -1 through t=0.03 and activates at 30.1 ms, then holds
# that value for the rest of the run. Sampled at the run's own endTime,
# comfortably past activation.
#
# This case paces one beat from rest, so every Purkinje node activates for
# the first time: the diastolic interval clamps to the CV table's maximum.
# That maximum is the only restitution calibration constant this reference
# is sensitive to - apdNominal, minimumDI90 and escapeInterval do not affect
# it - and a 1.2% slower Purkinje velocity delays this junction by 0.34 ms,
# 3.4x the tolerance below.
#
# file                                  time   col  expected      tolerance
injectionProbe/0/activationTime         0.04   2    0.0301140     1e-4
